title: Dossier III — Diplomacy, acting authority and unresolved security cases
new-page: true

= Institutions beyond the scenario horizon

**United States:** [+ ambassador_outcome +]. The next US administration's
response is a conditional projection: ambassador, Congress, White House and
defence channels remain separate in the stored record.

[? if acting_president_active: **Acting presidency:** [+ acting_president_name
+] serves under **[+ acting_presidency_scope +]**. [+ presidential_incapacity_outcome
+]. The acting president cannot shorten the Sejm term.?][? if not
acting_president_active: No acting presidency remains active at the election
horizon.?]

**Border and security:** [+ border_outcome +]. Every triggered strike,
ceasefire, collapse, cyberattack, sabotage, incapacity, violent attack and
corruption file retains its persisted outcome. Unresolved criminal and
diplomatic cases are projections, not additions to the certified result.

